    "text": "FEVERIndiana Fever take Jessica Timmons of Alabama in third round of WNBA draft Chloe PetersonIndianapolis StarApril 13, 2026, 9:43 p.m. ETINDIANAPOLIS — The Indiana Fever selected Jessica Timmons out of Alabama with the No. 40 overall pick.Timmons is a 5-9 guard who averaged 16.3 points and 4.5 rebounds in her senior season at Alabama. She shot 43% from the field and 39% from 3-point range with the Crimson Tide. She was Alabama's bonafide leader this season, helping them to a 24-11 record and No. 6 seed in the NCAA Tournament.",
